---
source: core/src/orchestrator.rs
expression: tool_to_json(&tool)
---
description: "Convert text to speech audio and send as a voice message to the user. ONLY use this when the user EXPLICITLY asks for voice/audio output (e.g. '读给我听', '用语音回复', 'read it aloud', 'send as voice'). Do NOT use for normal text replies."
name: text_to_speech
parameters:
  properties:
    language:
      description: "BCP-47 language code (e.g. 'zh', 'en', 'ja') or 'auto' for detection. Default: 'auto'."
      type: string
    text:
      description: The text to convert to speech. Max 15000 characters.
      type: string
  required:
    - text
  type: object
